hoes of a daring rope walker and cross thrilling heights where every step counts.\n\nFace three unique environments, each with its own challenges:\n\nCity: Walk across ropes strung between towering skyscrapers as the bustling metropolis moves far below.\n\nVolcano: Brave the heat and molten dangers while crossing over an erupting volcanic abyss.\n\nForest: Experience the serene yet challenging heights of ropes tied between giant ancient trees.\n\nWith stunning VR visuals and realistic balancing mechanics, every crossing feels like a heart-pounding test of courage. Whether you\u2019re looking for an adrenaline rush or a fun challenge with friends, Sky Line - Rope Crossing Game VR will push you to conquer your fear of heights and master the art of balance.", "short_description": "Step into the thrill of Sky Line - Rope Crossing Game VR! Test your balance and courage as you walk across ropes stretched high above breathtaking environments\u2014City skyscrapers, a fiery Volcano, and a lush Forest. Do you have what it takes to make it to the other side?"}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USE